<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/canonical') %>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Privacy Policy for JC Equipment Rentals. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information.">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/images/Favicon.png">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0-beta3/css/all.min.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/index.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/header.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/footer.css">
  <style>
    .privacy-container {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      padding: 20px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .privacy-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .privacy-header h1 {
      font-size: 32px;
      color: #333;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .privacy-header .last-updated {
      color: #666;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .privacy-section {
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .privacy-section h2 {
      font-size: 24px;
      color: #333;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      padding-bottom: 10px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #007bff;
    }

    .privacy-section h3 {
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #555;
      margin: 20px 0 10px 0;
    }

    .privacy-section p {
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      color: #666;
    }

    .privacy-section ul {
      margin-left: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .privacy-section li {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: #666;
    }

    .contact-info {
      background: #f8f9fa;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    .contact-info strong {
      color: #333;
    }

    .signature-container {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .signature-image {
      max-width: 250px;
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      display: inline-block;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <%- include('partials/header') %>

  <main class="privacy-container">
    <div class="privacy-header">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="last-updated">Last updated: February 2, 2024</p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
      <p>JC Equipment Rentals ("we," "us," or "our") values and respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy outlines how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your personal information when you visit our website (https://jcgroups.ca/) or contact us through various means, including email.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>

      <h3>Personal Information</h3>
      <p>When you visit our website or contact us, we may collect personal information such as your name, email address, phone number, and other contact details.</p>

      <h3>Usage Data</h3>
      <p>We may automatically collect information about how you interact with our website, including your IP address, browser type, device information, and pages visited. This information helps us improve our website and services.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
      <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>

      <h3>Providing Services</h3>
      <p>We use the information you provide to fulfill your requests, respond to your inquiries, and deliver the equipment rental services you require.</p>

      <h3>Communication</h3>
      <p>We may use your contact information to communicate with you about our equipment rentals, promotions, and important updates. You can opt-out of receiving such communications at any time.</p>

      <h3>Website Improvement</h3>
      <p>We analyze usage data to enhance the functionality and user experience of our website.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
      <h2>Information Sharing</h2>

      <h3>Third-Party Service Providers</h3>
      <p>We may share your information with trusted third-party service providers who assist us in operating our website or providing equipment rental services to you.</p>

      <h3>Legal Compliance</h3>
      <p>We may disclose your information if required by law or in response to valid legal requests.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
      <h2>Your Choices</h2>

      <h3>Opt-Out</h3>
      <p>You can opt-out of receiving promotional communications from us by following the instructions provided in our emails or by contacting us directly.</p>

      <h3>Cookies</h3>
      <p>You can set your browser to refuse all or some browser cookies. However, this may affect your ability to access certain parts of our website.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
      <h2>Security</h2>
      <p>We implement reasonable security measures to protect your personal information from unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, and destruction.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
      <h2>Links to Other Websites</h2>
      <p>Our website may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of these websites. Please review the privacy policies of third-party sites before providing any personal information.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <div class="contact-info">
        <p>If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or our practices, please contact us:</p>
        <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:info@jcgroups.ca">info@jcgroups.ca</a></p>
        <p><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:6133342571">613 334 2571</a></p>
        <p><strong>Address:</strong> 22127 Highway 62, Gilmour, ON Canada</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
      <h2>Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The latest version will be posted on our website with the effective date.</p>
      <p>By using our website and providing your information, you agree to the terms of this Privacy Policy.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
      <p><em>Thank you for choosing JC Equipment Rentals.</em></p>
      <div class="signature-container">
        <img src="/images/signature.png" alt="Signature" class="signature-image">
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>

</body>
</html></content>
